WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.256
In Yuan times there was a young woman named Dou E.

00:00:05.606 --> 00:00:11.246
She was falsely accused and suffered a great deal; in her heart she felt deeply wronged.

00:00:11.596 --> 00:00:16.372
Her tears fell one drop after another onto the grey stone slabs.

00:00:16.722 --> 00:00:23.586
She looked at the sky and said: if I am truly wronged, snow will fall even in the sixth month.

00:00:23.936 --> 00:00:28.496
When the townspeople heard this, they could not believe their own ears.

00:00:28.846 --> 00:00:34.414
After her death, snowflakes truly began to drift down, and everyone was stunned.

00:00:34.764 --> 00:00:38.844
The children stretched out their hands to catch the cool snowflakes.

00:00:39.194 --> 00:00:45.194
The snowflakes danced in the summer sunlight and drifted down into the green courtyard.

00:00:45.544 --> 00:00:50.008
White snow covered the green leaves, like a beautiful painting.

00:00:50.358 --> 00:00:54.702
Later, 'snow in June' became a symbol of the greatest injustice.

00:00:55.052 --> 00:00:59.924
Whenever people hear this story, their eyes cannot help growing wet.

